# Components

- Encapsulate component-only types, utils, and constants inside the component folder.
- Keep `ComponentName.tsx` UI-only. Export types from `ComponentName.types.ts` and constants from `ComponentName.constants.ts`.
- Create sibling files only when they have content.
- Nest subcomponents so the folder tree mirrors the UI tree.
- Use the same layout under `src/features/`.
- Keep presentational UI in `components/`. Compose UI and wire data in `features/`.

```txt
ComponentName/
  ComponentName.tsx
  ComponentName.types.ts
  ComponentName.constants.ts   # omit if none
  ComponentName.test.ts
  utils/                       # optional
  SubComponent/                # optional
```

Details: `docs/frontend/conventions/COMPONENT_STRUCTURE.md`
